{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Re: Spin. Die. Repeat.</strong>, you died by misfortune and were reborn by fate. This slot-machine roguelike deckbuilder with isekai RPG roots turns every action into a game of luck and wisdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it all feels like luck.\u00a0Too much luck. Even the simplest task such as harvesting milk, helping villagers to operate like a game of chance.\u00a0But the deeper you go, the more lives you touch, the clearer it becomes: this world is not random. The rules are designed. Someone is watching. Someone is testing you.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/7a62fa36979bbb4e688e2377f5b0dc55.poster.avif?t=1771846850\" width=848 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/7a62fa36979bbb4e688e2377f5b0dc55.webm?t=1771846850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/7a62fa36979bbb4e688e2377f5b0dc55.mp4?t=1771846850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Goddess rules this land, and the quiet spread of darkness is no accident. To stop it, you must learn to bend fate itself. Draft symbols after each spin, stack absurd synergies, and push your build until it breaks. Manipulate probability. Outsmart destiny with your deck.<br>Your deck is the reel:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin</strong> to activate symbol effects and chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft</strong> new symbols between spins to steer your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use</strong> items, skills, and followers to bend your luck and reshape the machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide</strong> to steer the story in a sarcastic isekai run where death just means re:try.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/cb4fce9ca67a75d28fb76cde06f33901.webp?t=1771846850\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/cb4fce9ca67a75d28fb76cde06f33901.poster.avif?t=1771846850\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=537 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power comes from synergies: stack effects, bend probabilities, and break the \u201cexpected\u201d outcome of a spin.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Symbols</strong>: combine effects to create run-defining engines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Items &amp; Artifacts</strong>: rewrite interactions and unlock new playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Followers</strong>: companions with perks and sometimes complications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Classes</strong>: choose, level up, and develop skills to take control of the machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/506aa22708075ef34b89cf9d1aac8dbe.avif?t=1771846850\" width=1560 height=144 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story quests</strong> with irony, sarcasm, and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong> that change routes, rewards, and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural worlds</strong> and fresh combinations in every random run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> that unlocks new content as you break the cycle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But when you think you reach the end\u2026 the wheel spins again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This time, you take fate into your own hands.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345680?t=1771846850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/1d5be0d4a12811857d490c24cb7b71acabd763bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771846850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/88724627bb1f3e5de5ae39770c7555924d359408/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771846850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/88724627bb1f3e5de5ae39770c7555924d359408/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771846850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The 4th level contains scenes of (heavy) alcohol consumption. "},"demos":[{"appid":3543540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Re: Spin. Die. Repeat.</strong>, you died by misfortune and were reborn by fate. This slot-machine roguelike deckbuilder with isekai RPG roots turns every action into a game of luck and wisdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it all feels like luck.\u00a0Too much luck. Even the simplest task such as harvesting milk, helping villagers to operate like a game of chance.\u00a0But the deeper you go, the more lives you touch, the clearer it becomes: this world is not random. The rules are designed. Someone is watching. Someone is testing you.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/7a62fa36979bbb4e688e2377f5b0dc55.poster.avif?t=1