 ><strong>100+ Items &amp; Artifacts</strong>: rewrite interactions and unlock new playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Followers</strong>: companions with perks and sometimes complications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Classes</strong>: choose, level up, and develop skills to take control of the machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/extras/506aa22708075ef34b89cf9d1aac8dbe.avif?t=1771846850\" width=1560 height=144 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story quests</strong> with irony, sarcasm, and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong> that change routes, rewards, and consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural worlds</strong> and fresh combinations in every random run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> that unlocks new content as you break the cycle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But when you think you reach the end\u2026 the wheel spins again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This time, you take fate into your own hands.</strong></p>","developers":["Isekai Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345680/83aa0b21088ea8b8eacf536113956e0c790a2f90/header.jpg?t=1771846850","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</str